            "description": "A package that allows to build Lib is a package that enables users to create visually appealing bounding boxes for object detection in image processing deep learning projects.                          With a current version of 0.0.10, the package is constantly being updated and improved. The package offers a variety of features, including the ability to customize the appearance of bounding boxes with different colors, line widths, and styles.                          Additionally, it provides users with the flexibility to adjust the size and shape of the bounding boxes to meet their specific needs.\r\n",
